# This zone's public base — the apex plus its basePath, because it is served at
# bandzen.com/docs rather than on an origin of its own. `metadataBase`, the
# social image and sitemap.xml all build absolute URLs from it.
#
# basePath prefixes links and assets but NOT metadata URLs, so the `/docs` here
# is load-bearing: without it the social image resolves to bandzen.com, which
# is web's zone and a 404.
#
# Unset falls back to https://bandzen.com/docs.
NEXT_PUBLIC_DOCS_URL=
